{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華應許拯救以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"要在春季向耶和華求雨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂造出雷雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為世人降下甘霖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜人田間的菜蔬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為神像說的是虛言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"占卜者講的是謊話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們訴說的是假夢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的安慰是空話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以人們如迷失的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因無牧人而遭受困苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"「我必向牧人發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必懲罰這些首領","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為萬軍之耶和華必眷顧祂的羊群猶大家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們像戰場上的駿馬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房角石、橛子、戰弓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及所有掌權者必出自猶大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必如戰場上的勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將仇敵踐踏在街上的泥土中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必爭戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華與他們同在。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必使敵方的騎兵蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「我必使猶大家強盛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必拯救約瑟家。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必帶他們回到故土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我憐憫他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必好像從未被我拋棄一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是他們的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必應允他們的禱告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮人必如勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必心裡暢快，如同喝了酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的兒女見狀也必喜樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必因耶和華而歡欣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「我必吹哨聚集他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我救贖了他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必像從前一樣人數眾多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然我把他們分散到列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必在遠方想起我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們及其子女必得以倖存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且回到故土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必從埃及領他們歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從亞述招聚他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領他們到基列和黎巴嫩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那裡將不夠他們居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必經過苦海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擊打海浪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼羅河必乾涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞述的驕傲必掃地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的勢力必滅沒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必讓他們靠耶和華而強盛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必奉祂的名行事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"「首領」希伯來文作「公山羊」。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}